  <h2>From a dentist’s request to a finished case</h2>
  <p>A lab records the dentist’s request, due date, materials, files and notes against a case. As the work moves through production, staff can see its current stage and who is responsible. Delivery, invoices and payment status stay attached to that same case.</p>
  <p>That lets a lab answer everyday questions: what is due, what is late, what each technician is working on and which completed cases still need payment.</p>

