  <h2>A customer who used every feature</h2>
  <p>One customer used every feature in the app. That depth of use surfaced bugs, inconsistencies and feature requests across the product, giving us a much clearer picture of where daily work was awkward.</p>
  <p>I used that feedback to fix bugs, resolve inconsistencies and shape further development. The result was a tighter, more consistent application across the workflows that customer relied on.</p>

  <h2>Evolving the backend</h2>
  <p>As Dental Lab Guru grew, I moved parts of it towards Node.js, EventBridge and event-driven workflows. My work spans backend development, cloud infrastructure and frontend implementation, alongside releases and direct conversations with customers.</p>

